{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433","id":448266856,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NDgyNjY4NTY=","number":1433,"title":"Aggressive concurrent flush could cause a deletion of newly generated SST file","user":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":711841622,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTE4NDE2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"This issue is a bug"},{"id":1290759928,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjkwNzU5OTI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/docdb","name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"YugabyteDB core features"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2019-05-24T17:00:15Z","updated_at":"2020-01-28T19:09:42Z","closed_at":"2019-05-24T17:19:40Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"`DBImpl::BackgroundCallFlush` calls `DBImpl::BackgroundFlush` and then `DBImpl::FindObsoleteFiles/PurgeObsoleteFiles` in order to delete temporary files on failed flushes. \r\n`BackgroundFlush` delegates flush to `FlushJob::Run` which is supposed to add generated output file into the `VersionSet` using `MemTableList::InstallMemtableFlushResults`, so `DBImpl::FindObsoleteFiles/PurgeObsoleteFiles` won't delete it. But in case of concurrent flushes, if `MemTableList::InstallMemtableFlushResults` is called when this is already committing SST files to `VersionSet` in a concurrent thread - it will skip doing this and relies on this another thread to do that. But this leads to `MemTableList::InstallMemtableFlushResults` doesn't guarantee SST file is actually installed into `VersionSet` exactly in this call, it might be done in concurrent thread later. Therefore `DBImpl::FindObsoleteFiles/PurgeObsoleteFiles` can delete it meanwhile.\r\n\r\nHere is more detailed diagram:\r\n```\r\ntimeline  thread_1                            thread_2\r\nt0        Flush started (BackgroundCallFlush)                                   \r\nt1        Generated 73.sst (WriteLevel0Table)                                    Flush started (BackgroundCallFlush)\r\nt2        Started commit 73.sst to VersionSet (InstallMemtableFlushResults)      Generated 74.sst (WriteLevel0Table)\r\nt2                                                                               Trying to commit 74.sst into VersionSet, but skips due to concurrent commit is in progress (InstallMemtableFlushResults)\r\nt3                                                                               BackgroundCallFlush calls Find/PurgeObsoletedFiles which deletes 74.sst, because it is not in VersionSet\r\nt4        Finished commit 73.sst to VersionSet (InstallMemtableFlushResults)\r\nt5        Committed 74.sst (deleted) to VersionSet (InstallMemtableFlushResults)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis table is transactional and has intents DB. The theory is that long flush of #73 is regular DB flush based on size and concurrent short flush of #74 was triggered by intents DB.\r\n\r\nSolution is to hold flushed SST file number inside `DBImpl::pending_output_` via `FileNumbersHolder` inside `MemTable` instance until it is actually added into `VersionSet`.","closed_by":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/1433/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}